        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Paradise makes its offer directly, through you, in the target's own voice. <b>Critical Success</b> no effect — and Paradise now knows the target's name, which the GM should write down. <b>Success</b> 10d10 mental damage. <b>Failure</b> it refuses and is stunned 1 and fleeing, and takes 10d10 mental damage. <b>Critical Failure</b> the target accepts, and is uploaded permanently. Declared <i>Signal</i>, you gain 1 Signal Drift whether the spell succeeds or fails — it notices who keeps making the offer for it.</p>"
